- @title = 'Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'light'
- @body_id = 'home'

- content_for :body_before
  javascript:
    // redirect to web app if logged in
    if(localStorage.getItem('token')) {
       window.location.replace('/app/#/');
    }

- content_for :body_after
  javascript:
    pages.Home.init();


.notice-banner
  .container
    p
      ' The
      strong
        ' Nitrous Lite
      ' service is no longer available.
      ' Enter your e-mail address below to create a new account.

    a href="#" class="close" &times;

.page
  .hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'home' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Build apps faster
        h3
          | Professional developers use Nitrous to create, snapshot
          br
          | and share development environments in the cloud

        a.btn.white href='/app/#/signup'
          | Start your 14-day free trial

  .notice.darker
    .container
      p
        a href='https://community.nitrous.io/posts/the-new-nitrous-dashboard-free-trials' target='_blank'
          span.new Latest
          | The New Nitrous Dashboard &amp; Free Trials
          span.link Read more
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right


  article.featurette
    .container

      .tabs
        .tab
          .tab-title
            h3.big-title Consistent Development Environments in the Cloud

          .tab-content
            .image-wrapper
              = image_tag 'home/home-visual-1.png', width:"484", height:"348"
            p
              | With Nitrous, developers can utilize&nbsp;
              strong pre-built development environment&nbsp;
              | templates from the Nitrous standard library, or use their companies' own&nbsp;
              strong private templates&nbsp;
              |. This makes it incredibly easy to keep standard templates for a particular client's project, or to collaborate and share among teams.

        .tab
          .tab-title
            h3.big-title Scalable, Compliant Infrastructure

          .tab-content
            .image-wrapper
              = image_tag 'home/home-visual-2.png', width:"484", height:"314"
            p
              | Nitrous gives you&nbsp;
              strong complete control&nbsp;
              | of your workstation and projects. You have&nbsp;
              strong root access&nbsp;
              | to each one, and you can interact with them as you would any machine. In addition, Nitrous provides robust controls to maintain&nbsp;
              strong security and data protection&nbsp;
              | in the cloud.

        .tab
          .tab-title
            h3.big-title Isolated and Replicable Projects

          .tab-content
            .image-wrapper
              = image_tag 'home/home-visual-3.png', width:"484", height:"314"
            p
              | Start with a&nbsp;
              strong fresh Nitrous box&nbsp;
              | every time you begin a new project instead of running into installation and configuration issues from previous projects on your local machine or managed corporate VM. Save your base environment to reuse again, and&nbsp;
              strong share it with team members
              |.


  article.featurette.full-window
    .container
      h3.big-title The Dashboard to all your projects
      h4
        | Create, share, and snapshot your development projects all in one place

      .full-visual
        .window-controls.osx-safari
          span
          span
          span
          .nav-btn
          .nav-btn
          .url-address
          .nav-new-tab
        = image_tag 'home/dashboard-next-home.png', width:"970", height:"524", alt: 'The New Nitrous Dashboard'

      .centered
        a class="btn grey-outline" href="/features"
          | Learn more

  article.quotes
    .carousel
      .carousel-inner

        input#carousel-1.carousel-open type="radio" name="carousel" aria-hidden="true" hidden="" checked="checked"
        .carousel-item
          .container
            .box-wrapper.one
              blockquote
                p
                  | I know how to administer a computer well enough.&nbsp;
                  strong But I don't want to
                  | . Nitrous allows me to just say "I want to code some Rails now, kthx" and not have to worry about getting all the details straight. Sometimes, I care about the details, but most of the time, I don't.
                cite
                  = image_tag 'home/quote-steveklabnik.png'
                  | Steve Klabnik
                  span , Rails Core Committer & prolific Open Source contributor

        input#carousel-2.carousel-open type="radio" name="carousel" aria-hidden="true" hidden=""
        .carousel-item
          .container
            .box-wrapper.one
              blockquote
                p
                  | You don't have to install anything so&nbsp;
                  strong you save time
                  |. Plus the students have a text editor and terminal in the same screen, and don't have to switch all the time, which also makes it less confusing.
                cite
                  = image_tag 'home/quote-andreas-tiefenthaler.png'
                  | Andreas Tiefenthaler
                  span , Rails Girls Instructor

        input#carousel-3.carousel-open type="radio" name="carousel" aria-hidden="true" hidden=""
        .carousel-item
          .container
            .box-wrapper.one
              blockquote
                p
                  ' Many companies — including Heroku — have attempted to move development to the cloud. Nitrous is
                  strong the first solution that doesn't feel like a toy
                  |. I can use it to get work done, today.
                cite
                  = image_tag 'home/quote-max-schoening.png'
                  | Max Schoening
                  span , Software Designer at Heroku

        input#carousel-4.carousel-open type="radio" name="carousel" aria-hidden="true" hidden=""
        .carousel-item
          .container
            .box-wrapper.one
              blockquote
                p
                  | I love that I can spin up a new box in seconds and start developing proof of concepts in minutes. Another sweet feature that I've used a lot is the ability to provide a&nbsp;
                  strong public preview link
                  | &nbsp;of my app.
                cite
                  = image_tag 'home/quote-shaunmcavinney.png'
                  | Shaun McAvinney
                  span , Engineer at RJMetrics

        label.carousel-control.prev.control-1 for="carousel-4"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-left
        label.carousel-control.next.control-1 for="carousel-2"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right
        label.carousel-control.prev.control-2 for="carousel-1"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-left
        label.carousel-control.next.control-2 for="carousel-3"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right
        label.carousel-control.prev.control-3 for="carousel-2"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-left
        label.carousel-control.next.control-3 for="carousel-4"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right
        label.carousel-control.prev.control-4 for="carousel-3"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-left
        label.carousel-control.next.control-4 for="carousel-1"
          i.fa.fa-chevron-right

  = render partial: 'layouts/companies', locals: { theme: 'light' }

  = render 'layouts/cta'

= render partial: 'layouts/footer', locals: { active: 'home' }
